text:
The word 'genius' gets bandied about so much these days, that it has all but lost its weight and meaning. It would however fit most releases put out by Iranian duo 
@9TAntiope
, who have come up consistently with stunning, soul-arresting, heart-wrenching compositions... (1/6)

