text:
9T Antiope - Placebo

New one from 
@9TAntiope
 on the always-intriguing 
@PTPvisions
. Two longform pieces that form the final part of a trilogy. It's bleak: dread manifested in drones, vocalizing (singing and processed talking), and lurching electronics.

